{
    "word": "forcibly",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "4c8de312-391b-3753-9411-fbe961eb997e",
                "word": "forcibly",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a97a0e63-0d6c-3162-a072-24ad87312387",
                        "entry_id": "4c8de312-391b-3753-9411-fbe961eb997e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a forcible manner, by force, against one's will."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2cbd237-300c-481c-8f90-5e8d326d022b",
                                "sense_id": "a97a0e63-0d6c-3162-a072-24ad87312387",
                                "text": "And suddenly; where injury of chance / Puts back leave-taking, justles roughly by / All time of pause, rudely beguiles our lips / Of all rejoindure, forcibly prevents / Our lock'd embrasures […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f7a22bc-afce-43f4-a4ba-b9147f928fe2",
                                "sense_id": "a97a0e63-0d6c-3162-a072-24ad87312387",
                                "text": "“Now get out of here,” and he grabbed Rokoff and Paulvitch each by the scruff of the neck and thrust them forcibly through the doorway, giving each an added impetus down the corridor with the toe of his boot."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eb3b4d1a-9312-38ea-a7b5-faa544d54f9f",
                        "entry_id": "4c8de312-391b-3753-9411-fbe961eb997e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a forcible manner, with force, with powerful effect, powerfully, strongly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1152af4e-1bc5-4baf-9a3d-7e1a1e9a58f9",
                                "sense_id": "eb3b4d1a-9312-38ea-a7b5-faa544d54f9f",
                                "text": "It was now cold, winter weather: forcibly recalling to his mind under what circumstances he had first travelled that road, and how many vicissitudes and changes he had since undergone."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c3cac5bb-c40f-48ad-a01e-14db120131b9",
                        "source_entry_id": "4c8de312-391b-3753-9411-fbe961eb997e",
                        "source_sense_description": "in a forcible manner",
                        "target_lang_word": "de force",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "de force",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "914e07d3-eef5-34c0-8ce0-8f7c1fefe573",
                                        "entry_id": "c5a261b1-4db1-3e7e-bf21-982dc9e3fa85",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En utilisant la force, en tant qu’effort."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d09998a-2c07-4fda-a991-b444d96eac11",
                                                "sense_id": "914e07d3-eef5-34c0-8ce0-8f7c1fefe573",
                                                "text": "Faire entrer de force une chose dans une autre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "154ae22d-4793-39b1-a05a-db99b4151e83",
                                        "entry_id": "c5a261b1-4db1-3e7e-bf21-982dc9e3fa85",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En utilisant la force, en tant que violence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bc144db-91a8-41c1-b626-6d3a302923f2",
                                                "sense_id": "154ae22d-4793-39b1-a05a-db99b4151e83",
                                                "text": "Il avait enfin trouvé un semblant de sommeil lorsqu'il fut réveillé et embarqué de force par un groupe d'hommes qui le cagoulèrent et lui lièrent les mains. Lorsqu'il lui retirèrent sa cagoule, après un voyage dans un véhicule, il reconnut le conseiller, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7192483a-c557-4925-b4b0-bf06e768342b",
                                                "sense_id": "154ae22d-4793-39b1-a05a-db99b4151e83",
                                                "text": "Prendre une fille de force. — Prendre une ville de force."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a98221eb-f42a-3e88-9516-9f9aa0032eef",
                                        "entry_id": "c5a261b1-4db1-3e7e-bf21-982dc9e3fa85",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En utilisant la contrainte."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23e346bf-0754-4ee9-a790-716f49af26e5",
                                                "sense_id": "a98221eb-f42a-3e88-9516-9f9aa0032eef",
                                                "text": "J’eus quatorze heures pénibles à passer ainsi, d’autant que des marchands de Hambourg s’étaient de force emparés du fond de la voiture et refusèrent de me le rendre, malgré mon droit à l’occuper, prouvé par mon bulletin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4587df7e-c70b-4876-bb9e-e4c7d4abf91c",
                                                "sense_id": "a98221eb-f42a-3e88-9516-9f9aa0032eef",
                                                "text": "Lorsque les passions semblèrent s’être calmées, un grand nombre de juifs qui s’étaient laissé baptiser de force revinrent au judaïsme."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
